{"id":"dnipro","name":"第聂伯罗","en":"Dnipro","country":"Ukraine","lat":48.4675,"lng":35.04,"dek":"第聂伯河畔的工业与记忆之城","history":"1776年，叶卡捷琳娜二世下令在第聂伯河两岸修建新城叶卡捷琳诺斯拉夫，选址在古老贸易通道的交汇处。此后多年，它只是南方大省的农业中心。1796年保罗一世将其改名为新罗西斯克，亚历山大一世继位后又恢复了原名。\n\n1861年农奴制废除后，无地农民涌进城市。随着克里瓦洛斯基铁矿的开采和铁路的通车，冶金业在这座城市扎根，工厂数量迅速增加。1896年城里亮起电灯，两年后有轨电车投入运营，20世纪初电话局开始营业。1905年12月，切切利夫卡共和国在此成立，格里戈里·彼得罗夫斯基是主要领导人之一。\n\n国内战争结束时城市工业遭到严重破坏，新经济政策时期逐步恢复，1926年城市改名为第聂伯罗彼得罗夫斯克。战后机械制造、化工和动力工业继续发展，南方机械厂与南方设计局让它成为航天与军工重镇。2016年，城市更名为第聂伯罗。2023年1月，一枚导弹击中索博尔内区一栋公寓，造成数十人死亡。","culture":"第聂伯罗的底色是工业。黑色金属是支柱产业，铸件、板材、管材、钢轨从这里运往各地；尤日马什工厂生产火箭与导弹，南方设计局的院士和博士们在此研制航天产品。这种重工业气质渗进城市的街道尺度与建筑风格，也塑造了居民对技术工作的尊重。\n\n它同时是一座大学城，高等院校与科研院所密集，音乐厅和艺术剧院散布市区。第聂伯河穿城而过，河岸、公园与主大道构成市民日常的公共空间。战争以来，空袭与伤亡让这座城市的文化生活多了一层沉重，博物馆与纪念碑也因此承载了更多记忆。","pull":"河流、工厂与记忆，在同一座城里并行。","sights":[{"name":"德米特拉·亚沃尔尼茨科戈大道","orig":"Проспект Дмитра Яворницького","intro":"这条大道串起城市两片主要的建筑群，是市中心的重要通道。从欧洲广场出发，可以看彩绘的主教座堂，再沿林荫道走向军事博物馆与纪念碑，第聂伯河在眼前展开。附近还有历史博物馆、谢甫琴科公园与波将金宫。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%B0_%D1%81%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%84%D0%B0%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0.jpg/960px-%D0%9A%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%B0_%D1%81%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%84%D0%B0%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":658},"src":null},{"name":"德米特罗·亚沃尔尼茨基国家历史博物馆","orig":"Дніпропетровський національний історичний музей імені Дмитра Яворницького","intro":"博物馆坐落在亚沃尔尼茨科戈大道东端的高处，是了解第聂伯罗地区历史的主要去处。馆藏覆盖从古代到近代的考古与地方史材料，也涉及20世纪的战争。看完展厅走到馆外，可以顺路眺望河谷与城市天际线。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/%D0%94%D0%BD%D1%96%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%86%D1%96%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%96%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BC%D1%83%D0%B7%D0%B5%D0%B9_%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%96_%D0%94%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0_%D0%AF%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%2C_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82_%D0%94.%D0%AF%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%2C_16.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":540},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dmytro_Yavornytsky_National_Historical_Museum_of_Dnipro"},{"name":"光荣纪念碑","orig":"Монумент Слави","intro":"纪念碑位于亚沃尔尼茨科戈大道东端，是俯瞰第聂伯河的一处战争纪念地。碑体与周围的开阔平台面向河面，视野没有遮挡。傍晚光线斜照时，河水和对岸的轮廓最清楚，本地人常在此散步停留。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"主显圣容主教座堂","orig":"Свято-Преображенський кафедральний собор","intro":"这是第聂伯罗最古老的主教座堂。1787年，叶卡捷琳娜二世、奥地利皇帝约瑟夫二世与波将金公爵为它安放第一块基石，因俄土战争一度停工，最终在尼古拉一世在位期间建成。苏联时期曾改作宗教与无神论博物馆，如今恢复宗教功能，堂前有一片玫瑰园。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D1%83_%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%83_%D0%A1%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BE-%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%84%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%83.jpg/960px-%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D1%83_%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%83_%D0%A1%D0%BF%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BE-%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%84%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%83.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":528},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transfiguration_Cathedral%2C_Dnipro"},{"name":"圣尼古拉教堂","orig":"Свято-Миколаївська церква","intro":"圣尼古拉教堂是城里保存下来的老教堂之一，名字来自水手与旅人的守护圣人。建筑体量不大，立面朴素，与周边街区的生活气息相近。它适合在步行游览主大道时顺路一看，感受这座城市在工业面貌之外的宗教传统。","img":null,"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"罗宋汤","orig":"борщ","intro":"以甜菜根熬出深红色汤底，常加卷心菜、土豆和肉，上桌时配酸奶油。乌克兰东部各地做法略有差异，本地餐馆多作为正餐的头一道，配黑面包吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Borscht_served.jpg/960px-Borscht_served.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":627},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BD%97%E5%AE%8B%E6%B1%A4"},{"name":"基辅肉饼","orig":"котлета по-київськи","intro":"鸡胸肉裹上黄油与香草，外面拍面包糠后油炸，切开时黄油流出。它是乌克兰餐馆里的常见主菜，第聂伯罗的食堂与餐厅都能点到，通常配土豆泥或沙拉。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/Chicken_Kiev_-_Ukrainian_East_Village_restaurant.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chicken_Kiev"},{"name":"奥利维耶沙拉","orig":"олів'є","intro":"土豆、胡萝卜、豌豆、鸡蛋与腌黄瓜切丁，拌上蛋黄酱，是节庆餐桌上的凉菜。本地人日常也吃，餐馆里常作为前菜，分量扎实，味道偏酸咸。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82_%D0%9E%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%D1%8C%D0%B5_03.jpg/960px-%D0%A1%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82_%D0%9E%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%B2%D1%8C%D0%B5_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":749},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Olivier_salad"},{"name":"抓饭","orig":"плов","intro":"米与羊肉、胡萝卜一起焖煮，油香渗进饭粒。它源自中亚，在乌克兰东部的餐馆里很常见，第聂伯罗的食堂与高加索风味餐厅都做，适合当一顿简单的主食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Tajik_plov.jpg/960px-Tajik_plov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1320},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8A%93%E9%A5%AD"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/First_Antares_rocket_on_Launch_Pad_0A_of_the_Wallops_Flight_Facility.jpg/1280px-First_Antares_rocket_on_Launch_Pad_0A_of_the_Wallops_Flight_Facility.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":766},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/64/Maidan_Square_Kiev_hnapel_01.jpg/1280px-Maidan_Square_Kiev_hnapel_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":854}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[34.7489459,48.4839979],[34.7591833,48.4762748],[34.7716041,48.4732972],[34.7614027,48.4571417],[34.7583368,48.4507408],[34.7601825,48.4404849],[34.7791809,48.4405286],[34.7857075,48.4343639],[34.7780971,48.4315665],[34.7812054,48.4300084],[34.7834228,48.4273441],[34.7904574,48.431638],[34.7919543,48.4334936],[34.7981006,48.427418],[34.7940188,48.4285475],[34.792753,48.4276224],[34.7986361,48.4253887],[34.8005541,48.425278],[34.8020004,48.427019],[34.804666,48.4274137],[34.8042154,48.4300833],[34.8079276,48.4304677],[34.8103125,48.4218373],[34.812301,48.4221672],[34.8245432,48.4262705],[34.8236732,48.4271571],[34.8268736,48.4284354],[34.8274018,48.4297549],[34.8256618,48.4323938],[34.8434813,48.4339812],[34.8427045,48.4345791],[34.8457853,48.4365737],[34.8469168,48.436213],[34.852196,48.4405574],[34.8555432,48.4417521],[34.8584673,48.4456459],[34.8620863,48.4477551],[34.8656401,48.446891],[34.8702641,48.4405162],[34.8729984,48.4386507],[34.8802846,48.4362595],[34.8938296,48.4366661],[34.9018171,48.4401143],[34.9076405,48.4447571],[34.9136088,48.4475447],[34.9324691,48.4432989],[34.9351766,48.4387303],[34.9379662,48.4375737],[34.9420493,48.4374543],[34.9480861,48.4338854],[34.9425117,48.4283912],[34.9349612,48.4239172],[34.9328857,48.4215502],[34.9291382,48.4215723],[34.9287097,48.4242065],[34.9302795,48.4256767],[34.9267348,48.4263571],[34.9244111,48.4242903],[34.9215842,48.4254954],[34.9212153,48.4246518],[34.9262158,48.4219887],[34.9244435,48.4217282],[34.9242662,48.4203],[34.9263044,48.4192246],[34.9264571,48.4178371],[34.9024794,48.4201739],[34.9001248,48.4163511],[34.9048594,48.4127212],[34.9045103,48.4096738],[34.9016715,48.4090371],[34.902877,48.4037537],[34.908762,48.4024284],[34.9097041,48.3997589],[34.9126373,48.3980582]